OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine and
OL,6,Fdry evening. Clear spells overnight
OL,7,Fwith mist and isolated fog patches
OL,8,Fdeveloping for a time. Cloud builds
OL,9,Ftowards the end of the night, with
OL,10,Fpatchy low cloud over the hills. A
OL,11,Ffurther cold night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FCold to start with cloud
OL,14,Fcontinuing to develop. Overcast from
OL,15,Flate morning with patchy light rain
OL,16,Fand coastal fog later. Near average
OL,17,Fdaytime temperatures, milder overnight
OL,18,Fthan recently. Strengthening winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
