OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FWindy
OL,6,Fwith rain on Wednesday, locally heavy,
OL,7,Fclearing to sunny spells and isolated
OL,8,Fshowers. Further isolated showers on
OL,9,FThursday. Cloudy and breezy with rain
OL,10,Fon Friday. Temperatures closer to
OL,11,Faverage.
